                  "body": {
                    "description": "The JSON body: an object; for CrowdStrike's update, a list holding the one rule; for Carbon Black Cloud's watchlist update, the text `<tenant-read:watchlist>`, a placeholder for the watchlist the tenant returns; null when the request has none",
