              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "The request a deploy sends. For Defender for Endpoint, SentinelOne, CrowdStrike, HarfangLab, Splunk and Carbon Black Cloud, a list of {method, url, body} requests; for the other platforms an object in the platform's own shape (Elastic {payload, block}, Graylog and Exabeam {method, path, body}, Bitdefender a JSON-RPC body); null when the rule could not be compiled",
          "title": "Api Request"
        },
        "code": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
